# Environment variables understood by Banxing. All are optional: normal use is configured in
# the app's "旁听用的模型" window and stored (key encrypted) in %APPDATA%\Banxing\settings.json.
# These exist for development, CI and demos. The app does not read a .env file; set them in
# your shell.

# --- the supervising model (overrides the saved settings) ---
# This is the model that READS ALONGSIDE — preferably not the one the conversation is with.
# The saved API key belongs to the service and base URL it was entered for. If
# BANXING_PROVIDER or BANXING_BASE_URL points anywhere else, the saved key is NOT used:
# set BANXING_API_KEY as well, or nothing is sent. Redirects from the service are never
# followed. A conversation is agreed to one at a time: in the "旁听一条对话" window, or with
# `--watch FILE --agree ORIGIN` / `--replay --agree ORIGIN` on the command line.
# BANXING_PROVIDER=mock                 # anthropic | openai | mock (offline stand-in, keyword rules only)
# BANXING_MODEL=claude-fable-5-2        # blank = the provider's default
# BANXING_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com   # https only, except localhost
# BANXING_API_KEY=

# --- where the app keeps its files ---
# BANXING_HOME=C:\somewhere\else

# --- Codex (only for "Recent Codex sessions" in the watch dialog) ---
# CODEX_HOME=C:\Users\me\.codex         # sessions are read from %CODEX_HOME%\sessions
